---
---
<div class="af-console" role="img" aria-label="Illustrative transcript: installing Agentflow with the skills installer, then the router loading the smallest specialist set for an unclear task">
  <div class="af-console__bar" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="af-console__dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
    <span class="af-console__title">agentflow · decision router</span>
  </div>
  <div class="af-console__body">
    <p class="af-console__line is-cmd"><span class="af-console__prompt">$</span> npx skills@latest add howlil/agentflow</p>
    <p class="af-console__line is-out">added 8 skills · 1 router, 7 specialists</p>
    <p class="af-console__line is-cmd is-gap"><span class="af-console__prompt">$</span> agentflow "fix the race in booking creation"</p>
    <p class="af-console__line is-out">unresolved: concurrency <span class="af-console__route">→ design-thinking</span></p>
    <p class="af-console__line is-out">loop: design-thinking <span class="af-console__route">→</span> test-engineering <span class="af-console__route">→</span> code-review</p>
    <p class="af-console__line is-summary">specialists loaded: 2 · deterministic steps skipped<span class="af-console__caret" aria-hidden="true"></span></p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .af-console {
    width: min(30rem, 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--af-surface, #16171D);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) inset, 0 18px 48px rgba(4, 5, 7, 0.5);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .af-console__bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 9px 14px 8px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .af-console__dots {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .af-console__dots i {
    width: 9px;
    height: 9px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
  }

  .af-console__title {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
    font: 500 11px/1.4 "Geist Mono", ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .af-console__body {
    padding: 16px 18px 15px;
    font: 400 12.5px/1.9 "Geist Mono", ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    color: rgba(214, 222, 235, 0.92);
    overflow-x: auto;
    white-space: nowrap;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
  }

  .af-console__body p { margin: 0; white-space: pre; }

  .af-console__line { opacity: 0; animation: af-console-rise 480ms ease-out forwards; }
  .af-console__line:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 250ms; }
  .af-console__line:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 480ms; }
  .af-console__line:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 780ms; }
  .af-console__line:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 1010ms; }
  .af-console__line:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 1240ms; }
  .af-console__line:nth-child(6) { animation-delay: 1470ms; }

  @keyframes af-console-rise {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  }

  .is-gap { margin-top: 10px !important; }

  .af-console__prompt { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.56); }

  .is-out { color: rgba(185, 186, 199, 0.95); }

  .af-console__route { color: var(--af-accent, #9B8BDE); }

  .is-summary { color: #F6F4EF; }

  .af-console__caret {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 7px;
    height: 14px;
    margin-left: 6px;
    vertical-align: -2px;
    background: rgba(214, 222, 235, 0.85);
    animation: af-console-caret 1.1s 3;
  }

  @keyframes af-console-caret {
    0%, 49% { opacity: 1; }
    50%, 100% { opacity: 0.15; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .af-console__line { animation: none; opacity: 1; }
    .af-console__caret { animation: none; }
  }
</style>
